      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "ENGINE EMMA (4) shapes well for this after winning last start over the 380m at this track in a dynamic 21.58. Expected to go close again if runs up to latest time. FARMOR MYSTIC (8) had been racing in honest fashion recording two placings in a row before finishing seventh (24.31) at Rockhampton latest. Has never been out of the placings from two starts out of this box. Worth another chance. HARA'S BLUEY (2) is a talented type and proved too classy last time to win by 0.8 lengths at this track in a handy 21.93 beating Copper Carnage. Can make it back-to-back wins. KALEIDOSCOPE (1) should be thereabouts despite an unplaced run here most recently.",
